---

## ۴. بروزرسانی `package.json` برای انتشار

اطمینان حاصل کنید که فیلدهای زیر در `package.json` به‌درستی تنظیم شده‌اند:

```json
{
  "name": "gitwe",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "A configurable, rule-based branching workflow engine for git (git-flow and beyond).",
  "main": "dist/index.js",
  "types": "dist/index.d.ts",
  "bin": {
    "gitwe": "dist/cli/index.js"
  },
  "files": ["dist", "README.md", "LICENSE"],
  "keywords": ["git", "workflow", "branching", "git-flow", "cli"],
  "author": "Your Name <you@example.com>",
  "license": "MIT",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/your-username/gitwe"
  },
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/your-username/gitwe/issues"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/your-username/gitwe#readme"
}
```
